The '''Petitioner's Chamber''' (aka '''Hall of Petitioners''') is the first room to the right when ascending the ramp into [[Stormwind Keep]]. This is where the public waits when they have sought an audience. Amongst the public attendants in the room include [[Caledra Dawnbreeze]], [[Count Remington Ridgewell]], [[Duke Ramon III]], [[Lord Ivar Pyrewood]] and [[Emissary Godwin Valorcall]].

